@prefix eco: <https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#> . @prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> . eco:CardinalityEvidence a skos:Concept; skos:inScheme eco:VerificationEvidenceScheme; skos:prefLabel "Cardinality Evidence"; skos:definition "Evidence that observed counts satisfy an exact acceptance cardinality." .